  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of risk ratios (TBST vs TST) for induration, from three C-Tb studies (Aggerbeck 2018, Aggerbeck 2019, Ruhwald 2017), indicating more induration events with TBST. The overall random-effects pooled risk ratio is 1.78 (1.36–2.32).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسب الخطر (TBST مقابل TST) بالنسبة إلى التصلّب، من ثلاث دراسات عن C-Tb (Aggerbeck 2018 وAggerbeck 2019 وRuhwald 2017)، مما يشير إلى أحداث تصلّب أكثر مع اختبارات TBST. وتبلغ نسبة الخطر المجمّعة الإجمالية بنموذج التأثيرات العشوائية 1.78 (1.36–2.32).",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "森林图显示硬结的风险比（TBST对TST），来自三项C-Tb研究（Aggerbeck 2018、Aggerbeck 2019、Ruhwald 2017），显示TBST的硬结事件更多。总体随机效应合并风险比为1.78（1.36–2.32）。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagrama de bosque de los cocientes de riesgos (TBST frente a TST) de la induración, en tres estudios de C-Tb (Aggerbeck 2018, Aggerbeck 2019, Ruhwald 2017), lo que indica más casos de induración con las TBST. El cociente de riesgos combinado global por modelo de efectos aleatorios es de 1,78 (1,36–2,32).",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
